  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-07-29T19:08:04.251Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hi! For Content Creators a few more Camera Features would be awesome!! Here's a few i used and need for my stuff:\n1) Camera Animations: Being able to set positions and playing the animation that makes the camera go around in between the points! (A loop mode is top tier, if that would be added, chefs kiss) \n2) Camera Flashlight: Some worlds and Avis just aren't compatible regards lighting. Adding a Flashlight to the camera makes it easier to take pictures and videos.\n3) Desktop Camera:  There's also a lot of Desktop Photographers! Can't leave them out. \nThose are just a few but would already help out a lot of Content Creators!",
